---
import Base from "@/layouts/Base.astro";
import ContentColumn from "@/layouts/ContentColumn.astro";
---

<style>

.nav__home {
  font-size: var(--font-size-fluid-3);
  text-align: center;
}

@media (max-width: 376) {
  .nav__home {
    visibility: hidden;
    position: relative;
    height: fit-content;
    /* HACK: This is to fight the two line Providence Meshworks */
    /*  I'd prefer for this to be overflow hidden or something */
    height: var(--font-size-fluid-3);
  }

  .nav__home:after {
    visibility: visible;
    content: "PVD Mesh";
    top: 0;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    position: absolute;
  }
}

.hero {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}

.hero__title--text {
  font-size: 128px;
  padding-block: 128px;
  text-align: center;
  line-height: 164px;
  text-decoration: underline var(--red-10) var(--size-px-3);
  padding-block: var(--size-8);
}

.hero__title--italic {
  font-style: italic;
}

@media (max-width: 560px) {
  .hero__title--text {
    font-size: var(--size-px-10);
    line-height: var(--size-px-11);
    padding-top: var(--size-4);
  }
}

@media (max-width: 360px) {
  .hero__title--text {
    font-size: var(--size-px-8);
    line-height: var(--size-px-9);
    padding-top: var(--size-4);
  }
}


.hero__cta {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: var(--size-4);
  margin-block: var(--size-4);
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
}

.hero__btn {
  font-size: var(--font-size-fluid-2);
  border-radius: var(--radius-2);
  min-width: 300px;
  transform: skew(-20deg);
  text-align: center;
  cusror: pointer;
}

.hero__btn--primary {
  background-color: var(--sand-1);
  border-color: var(--sand-1);
  color: var(--stone-12)
}

.hero__btn--secondary {
  background-color: var(--stone-12);
  border-color: var(--sand-1);
  color: var(--sand-1);
}

.hero__btn--inner {
  display: inline-block;
  transform: skew(20deg);
  text-decoration: none;
  color: inherit;
}

.overview {
  padding-block: var(--size-10);
}
.overview__top {
  height: var(--size-fluid-6);
  background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom right, var(--stone-12), var(--stone-12) 50%, var(--sand-1) 50%, var(--sand-1));
  margin-bottom: -1px;
}

.overview__inner {
  background-color: var(--sand-1);
  color: var(--stone-12);
  padding-block: var(--size-6);
  padding-inline: var(--size-fluid-3);
  font-size: var(--font-size-fluid-1);
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
}

.overview__inner--text {
  width: 50ch;
  max-width: var(--size-content-3);

  p {
    padding-block: var(--size-5);
  }
}

.overview__bottom {
  height: var(--size-fluid-6);
  background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom right, var(--sand-1), var(--sand-1) 50%, var(--stone-12) 50%, var(--stone-12));
  margin-top: -1px;
}

.pilot {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  font-size: var(--font-size-fluid-1);
  padding-block: var(--size-4);
}

.pilot__inner {
  width: 50ch;
  max-width: var(--size-content-3);
  padding-inline: var(--size-fluid-3);

  p {
    padding-block: var(--size-5);
  }

  h2 {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: var(--font-size-fluid-3);
    text-decoration: underline var(--red-10) var(--size-px-2);
    padding-block: var(--size-8);
  }
}

</style>

<Base>
    <nav class="nav">
      <h1 class="nav__home">Providence Meshworks</h1>
    </nav>
    <section>
      <div class="hero">
        <div class="hero__title">
          <h1 class="hero__title--text">
            The Internet <br>
            <span class="hero__title--italic">belongs</span>
            <br> to the People
          </h1>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="hero__cta">
      <button class="hero__btn hero__btn--primary">
        <a href="#pilot" class="hero__btn--inner">Join the Effort</a>
      </button>
      <button class="hero__btn hero__btn--secondary">
        <a href="#overview" class="hero__btn--inner">Learn More</a>
      </button>
    </section>
    <section id="overview" class="overview">
      <div class="overview__top"></div>
      <div class="overview__inner">
        <div class="overview__inner--text">
          <h2>What is Providence Meshworks?</h2>
          <p>
            Providence Meshworks (PVD Mesh) is a community owned and operated internet service provider. In this age of mass surveillance it's critical that we  control our own infrastructure. By building a cooperatively owned ISP we control more of our digital lives. We choose what services to provide, and how to protect our privacy.
          </p>
          <h2>What is a mesh network?</h2>
          <p>
            A mesh network is a means of delivering internet access. We do this through the use of WiFi radios mounted to rooftops and balconies. The more interconnected the network is, the more redundant it becomes. As the network grows, so does our collective resiliency.
          </p>
          <h2>What is a solidarity cooperative?</h2>
          <p>
            Solidarity cooperative are a specific kind of Multi-Stake Cooperative. Solidarity cooperatives generally have three classes of members: workers, consumers, and community. Worker members are traditional worker owners, they build and operate the mesh network. Consumer members are the members that use the service, those who rely on Providence Meshworks for their internet. Community members are anchor institutions, or individuals from the general public that have an interest in the project, but may not be able to use the service. All members have a vote in any and all decisions made about Providence Meshworks.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="overview__bottom"></div>
    </section>
    <section id="pilot" class="pilot">
      <div class="pilot__inner">
        <h2>Join the Effort</h2>      
        <h3>Become a pilot site</h3>
        <p>
          We're looking for people in the West End of Providence that have access to roofs, balconies or other high points. We'll need your address to see if your location fits within our pilot deployment plan. 
        </p>
        <h3>Volunteer with us</h3>
        <p>
          As we gear up for our pilot we're looking for people with specific skillsets.
          <ul>
            <li>
              <h4>Fundraising/Grant writing</h4>
              <p>Funds help us expand the network faster, and provide cheaper internet.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <h4>Network security</h4>
              <p>Privacy is paramount, we need your help!</p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <h4>Radio/Wireless network operation</h4>
              <p>Have any tips about radio propagation in congested urban environments?</p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <h4>Outdoor installation</h4>
              <p>Handy with a ladder? We could use your help!</p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <h4>Graphic design</h4>
              <p>We're looking for help with print/digital design, branding and logo.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <h4>Copy writing/editing</h4>
              <p>Help us maintain a consistent voice and mission in our written documents.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <h4>Project management</h4>
              <p>Keep us on track to reach our goals!</p>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <script data-letterbirduser="providence-meshworks" src="https://letterbird.co/embed/v1.js"></script>
</Base>
